WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.720
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:02.983 --> 00:00:04.900
SPEAKER: Are you looking
to build and showcase

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:06.220
your Cloud skills?

00:00:06.220 --> 00:00:08.470
Want an easy way
to show them off?

00:00:08.470 --> 00:00:11.170
You can now earn skill
badges from Google Cloud

00:00:11.170 --> 00:00:14.380
to demonstrate your
growing Cloud competencies.

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:15.800
Here's how it works.

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:19.330
First, you need to join the
Google Cloud skills challenge.

00:00:19.330 --> 00:00:24.160
This gives you 30 days of free
access to Google Cloud labs.

00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:28.540
Then choose the track you're
interested in and get started.

00:00:28.540 --> 00:00:32.350
Each track has a number of
skill badges up for grabs.

00:00:32.350 --> 00:00:34.510
To earn a badge,
you'll need to complete

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:36.820
a series of Google Cloud labs.

00:00:36.820 --> 00:00:40.270
Then you'll need to pass a
final challenge lab designed

00:00:40.270 --> 00:00:42.350
to test your skills.

00:00:42.350 --> 00:00:46.190
Once you've earned the badge,
showcase what you've learned.

00:00:46.190 --> 00:00:50.000
You could add it to your resume
and share it with your network.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:51.110
Ready to go?

00:00:51.110 --> 00:00:53.570
Join the Google Cloud
skills challenge today,

00:00:53.570 --> 00:00:55.310
and start earning
your skill badges.

00:00:55.310 --> 00:00:58.060
[MUSIC PLAYING]

